  "review": {
    "images": "Verified the official page hero and all six gallery assets. The first gallery asset repeats the hero from a narrower crop and was omitted. Added two native tower renders from physical pages 2 and 6 of the exact official brochure. Used the daytime tower render for the card and kept the shared reception distinct from private interiors.",
    "location": "Checked the official Creek Blue pin and regional map. Physical page 4 of the original brochure prints the three area estimates and distinguishes the future Blue Line. The point is a reference, not an entrance survey.",
    "floorPlans": "Inspected all 45 physical PDF pages. Pages 1, 2 and 45 are cover, tower diagram and back cover. Preserved all 42 complete residence sheets from physical pages 3–44. Used physical PDF navigation since internal page numbers repeat. Checked each level, unit, suite and balcony area and all square-foot totals."
  },
